<Layout title="Privacy — Large Print Crosswords"><div class="container prose"><header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">PLAIN AND SIMPLE</p><h1>Your privacy.</h1></header><p>This version of Large Print Crosswords does not ask you to create an account, enter an email address, or submit personal information. It contains no advertising or analytics scripts.</p><h2>Progress stays in your browser</h2><p>We use local storage on your device to remember your puzzle letters, sound preference, and clue-size preference. These values are not sent to us by the application. Clear this site’s browser data to remove them. If storage is blocked, you can still play, but your progress may not be saved.</p><h2>Website hosting</h2><p>Your browser makes requests to the hosting provider to load pages and files. The provider may process technical connection information such as IP addresses and request logs. Its practices depend on the provider used for the published website.</p><h2>Printing and sound</h2><p>Printing uses your browser’s print feature. Optional sounds are generated on your device. Fonts are system fonts, and the site does not load a third-party font service.</p><p>This policy should be updated if analytics, advertising, email subscriptions, or other data-handling services are introduced.</p></div></Layout>
